  sequenceName: Mem_ch3_counting
  lines:
  - speakerName: Narrator
    text: Counting breaths is something to do with the mind when the body can do
      nothing else.
  - speakerName: Narrator
    text: Slow in. Slow out. The children's breathing slowly follows.
